    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578350/extras/339658f8e4cf85243d2f81a5afaa55e9.poster.avif?t=1741717609\" width=588 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578350/extras/339658f8e4cf85243d2f81a5afaa55e9.webm?t=1741717609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578350/extras/339658f8e4cf85243d2f81a5afaa55e9.mp4?t=1741717609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into darkness in <strong>The Nights on Arcade</strong>, a chilling indie horror game available on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Axel's Paranormal Obsession</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Axel Mirren Sommer</strong>, an adult obsessed with the paranormal, whose life has been marked by his fascination with the inexplicable. Ignoring the warnings of your <strong>little sister</strong>, you finally find employment in the mysterious <strong>Arcade World</strong>, a place that seems to have been forgotten by children for years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Search for Your Missing Sister</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you work through the bowels of this enigmatic arcade, your mind can't help but wonder where your <strong>sister</strong>, <strong>(Sttella Mirren Attaway)</strong>, is. The last time you saw her was right here, in <strong>Arcade World</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover the Dark Secrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>The Nights on Arcade</strong>, you will be plunged into a nightmare of supernatural horrors as you desperately search for answers about the <strong>disappearance</strong> of your <strong>sister</strong> and the dark secrets that envelop this abandoned place. As you explore the depths of <strong>Arcade World</strong>, you will face your worst fears and terrifying discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Courage in the Dark</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the courage to reveal the horrors that lurk in the darkness? .- .-. . / -.-- --- ..- / ... ..- .-. . / - .... .- - / . ...- . .-. -.-- - .... .. -. --. / .. ... / .-. . .- .-.. ..--..? Get ready for a horror experience that will keep you in suspense all night long in <strong>Arcade World</strong>. Do you dare to face the night?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578350/extras/339658f8e4cf85243d2f81a5afaa55e9.poster.avif?t=1741717609\" width=588 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578350/extras/339658f8e4cf85243d2f81a5afaa55e9.webm?t=1741717609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578350/extras/339658f8e4cf85243d2f81a5afaa55e9.mp4?t=1741717609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into darkness in <strong>The Nights on Arcade</strong>, a chilling indie horror game available on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Axel's Paranormal Obsession</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Axel Mirren Sommer</strong>, an adult obsessed with the paranormal, whose life has been marked by his fascination with the inexplicable. Ignoring the warnings of your <strong>little sister</strong>, you finally find employment in the mysterious <strong>Arcade World</strong>, a place that seems to have been forgotten by children for years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Search for Your Missing Sister</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you work through the bowels of this enigmatic arcade, your mind can't help but wonder where your <strong>sister</strong>, <strong>(Sttella Mirren Attaway)</strong>, is. The last time you saw her was right here, in <strong>Arcade World</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover the Dark Secrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>The Nights on Arcade</strong>, you will be plunged into a nightmare of supernatural horrors as you desperately search for answers about the <strong>disappearance</strong> of your <strong>sister</strong> and the dark secrets that envelop this abandoned place. As you explore the depths of <strong>Arcade World</strong>, you will face your worst fears and terrifying discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Courage in the Dark</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the courage to reveal the horrors that lurk in the darkness? .- .-. . / -.-- --- ..- / ... ..- .-. . / - .... .- - / . ...- . .-. -.-- - .... .. -. --. / .. ... / .-. . .- .-.. ..--..? Get ready for a horror experience that will keep you in suspense all night long in <strong>Arcade World</strong>. Do you dare to face the night?</p>",
